le.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Model}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Model}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}compactness}\\vdash\n\\left(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Gamma\\;(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}(\\varphi)=\\varnothing)\n\\land\n\\forall\\Delta\\in[\\Gamma]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\exists\\mathcal M\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Model}(\\mathcal M,\\Delta)\\right)\n\\to\n\\exists\\mathcal M\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Model}(\\mathcal M,\\Gamma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}compactness}\\vdash\n\\left(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Gamma\\;(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}(\\varphi)=\\varnothing)\n\\land\n\\forall\\Delta\\in[\\Gamma]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\exists\\mathcal M\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Model}(\\mathcal M,\\Delta)\\right)\n\\to\n\\exists\\mathcal M\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Model}(\\mathcal M,\\Gamma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Compactness: if all finite subsets are satisfiable, so is the whole.</li>\n<li>The semantic compactness theorem follows from the completeness theorem; it is not the same statement as soundness.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · 